{"id":17205,"name":"Allegany County","slug":"allegany-county","state":"Maryland","code":"MD","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-earn-solid-as-a-beginner/allegany-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:53","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates","redemptionPeriod":"Until court-ordered foreclosure","interestRate":"18% annually","bidProcedure":"Online auction via RealAuction","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Every May"},{"label":"Registration Fee","value":"$50 (refundable)"},{"label":"Opening Bid","value":"Includes all delinquent taxes and charges"},{"label":"Automated Bidding","value":"Prohibited"},{"label":"Foreclosure","value":"Must file the complaint within 2 years of the certificate date"},{"label":"Contact Information","value":"Allegany County Finance Department"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"TLzer1xUi3PalmdZAqQoKI\"><iframe title=\"Secured by Government 18% Yearly Interest? - Allegany County - Maryland Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K66btogRb2k?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Investing in Allegany County, Maryland Tax Lien Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in tax liens can be a rewarding way to build your wealth. Allegany County, Maryland, offers an annual tax lien sale with an impressive 18% return on your investment. Here&#8217;s a friendly guide to help you navigate this opportunity.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Allegany County holds its tax lien sale every May. This event is conducted online via RealAuction, providing a convenient way to participate from anywhere. By purchasing tax liens, you essentially pay off the delinquent taxes of a property owner in exchange for a lien on the property. If the property owner redeems the lien, you receive your investment back plus interest. If they don&#8217;t, you may eventually foreclose on the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Key-Details\">Key Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Here’s a quick rundown of the important details for Allegany County’s tax lien sales:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Participate</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Register Online:</strong> Go to RealAuction’s site and register with a refundable $50 fee.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Prepare Your Finances:</strong> Ensure you have sufficient funds to cover your bids. Misrepresentation can void transactions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Understand the Rules:</strong> Familiarize yourself with the <a href=\"https://www.alleganygov.org/DocumentCenter/View/5996/Bidding-Rules\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Terms of Sale</mark></a> and <a href=\"https://www.alleganygov.org/DocumentCenter/View/5996/Bidding-Rules\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Bidding Rules</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bid on Properties:</strong> Place your bids on desired properties. The opening bid includes all delinquent taxes and associated charges.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Follow Through:</strong> If you win a bid, you must post the opening bid amount by 4:00 pm on the sale day, plus a $10 auction fee.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County-.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County-.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County-.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Western-Maryland-Railway-Station-in-Cumberland-Allegany-County--32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17208 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Western Maryland Railway Station in Cumberland, Allegany County \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">After the Sale</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Receive Certificate of Sale:</strong> Issued within 30 business days via certified mail.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redeem Property:</strong> Property owners can redeem their properties by paying the owed taxes, interest, and fees.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Foreclosure:</strong> If not redeemed, you can file a complaint to foreclose after six months but must do so within two years.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Interesting Facts About Allegany County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Allegany County is at the crossroads of East and West, situated in Western Maryland.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Economy:</strong> It’s interconnected with neighbouring states and excels in healthcare, education, and advanced manufacturing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Community:</strong> Historic downtowns and outdoor recreation draw visitors worldwide. Local programs support entrepreneurs and new businesses.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>By participating in Allegany County’s tax lien sales, you not only have the chance to earn significant returns but also potentially acquire property at a low cost. Whether you&#8217;re a seasoned investor or new to the field, understanding the process and following the rules will set you on the path to success.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.alleganygov.org/200/Tax-Lien-Sale-Information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Allegany County Tax Lien Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.alleganygov.org/180/Finance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Allegany County Finance Department</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://gov.allconet.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Allegany County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.realauction.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.montgomerycountymd.gov/finance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Montgomery County Department of Finance website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.montgomerycountymd.gov/Finance/TaxSale-general.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark