ate date.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What interest rate can I earn on a tax lien in Allegany County?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The interest rate is 18% annually.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How do I register for the tax lien auction?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can register online through RealAuction with a $50 refundable fee.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>For more information, visit the <a href=\"https://www.alleganygov.org/200/Tax-Lien-Sale-Information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Allegany County Tax Lien Sale Information</mark></a> page.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This guide aims to provide you with a clear understanding of Allegany County’s tax lien sales. If you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to reach out using the provided links. Consider <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">booking a call</mark></a> or accessing <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free resources</mark></a> for more guidance. Happy investing!</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560